 "insight": [
  "Exports of iron and steel from Luxembourg decreased from 1.49 billion euros in 2002 to 1.12 billion euros in 2025.",
  "The key trend is a 25.0% decline in exports over this period.",
  "The most notable change was the peak in exports in 2008, reaching 2.67 billion euros.",
  "Compared to 2002, exports in 2025 are significantly lower.",
  "The data are in current euros and are not adjusted for price changes, which may affect the interpretation of the trend."
